## Symptom
[what is wrong, one or two lines — observed, not inferred]

- **Severity:** trivial | minor | medium | high | critical
- **Blast radius:** [who/what is affected — users · a command · a skill · data]
- **Reported:** YYYY-MM-DD by [role — not a personal name]

## Repro
1. [step]
2. [step]

## Expected
[what should happen]

## Actual
[what happens instead — the exact error / wrong output / timing]

## Evidence
- [`docs/work/evidence/TASK-NNN/<file>` — what it shows]

## Done when
- [ ] <observable result of the fix>
- [ ] Negative: <what must keep working after the fix — the regression its test pins>

## Root cause
[the winning hypothesis, confirmed — written by /diagnose]

## Fix
[what changed and where (commit) — written by /diagnose]

## Regression test
[the test or fixture that fails without the fix, or why no seam exists — written by /diagnose]

## Prevention
[what would have stopped it: a TD-NNN, a rule, a check — or "none needed" — written by /diagnose]
